<title>FRANCE: EU cuts daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</title>
<headline>EU cuts daily wheat export refund to Switzerland.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The European Union cut the daily refund applying to soft wheat exports to Switzerland to eight Ecus per tonne from a previous level of nine Ecus per tonne, France's grain office ONIC said.</p>
<p>The EU also cut the refund applying to barley exports to Switzerland to 18.00 Ecus per tonne from a previous level of 19.00 Ecus, it said.</p>
<p>The EU's grain panel also cut the refund for rye exports to Switzerland to 21.00 Ecus from 22.00 Ecus.</p>
<p>-- Paris newsroom +331 4221</p>
</text>
